Package: ishtaria-worldgen
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: deterministic procedural planet generator for Ishtaria
 Generates cube-sphere terrain of an Earth-sized planet from a seed.
 The world itself is never stored in full; servers keep only changes.
